按左右键切换分区，上下键在分区内移动，回车键选择</RimWorldAccess.Prisoner.Tab.NavigationHint>
  <!-- Inline variant without leading newline — used when embedded in a larger announcement sentence. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Prisoner.Tab.NavigationHintInline>按左右键切换分区，上下键在分区内移动，回车键选择</RimWorldAccess.Prisoner.Tab.NavigationHintInline>

  <!-- Section announcements. {0} = count (or current mode label). -->
